==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|dúkr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*dōkaz}}. Cognate with {{cog|da|dug}}, {{cog|sv|duk}}, {{cog|nn|duk}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈtuːkʏr/}}
* {{rhymes|is|uːkʏr}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|dúks|dúkar}}

# [[cloth]], [[sheet]] (usually fabric, but also refers to things like e.g. [[linoleum]] flooring)

